5:["$","$L10",null,{"children":["$","$L11",null,{"bridal":{"version":78,"overview":{"documentTitle":"Bridal Hair & Makeup | Pittsburgh, Atlanta, New Orleans | Wild Child Fabrications","metaDescription":"Bridal hair and makeup artist in Pittsburgh, Atlanta, and New Orleans specializing in on-location wedding beauty, bridal trials, elopements, and custom bridal packages. Inclusive LGBTQIA+ and multicultural wedding services with 100+ five-star reviews. Booking 8–10 months in advance is recommended.","pageHeader":"Bridal Hair & Makeup in Pittsburgh, Atlanta & New Orleans","pricingCtaTitle":"Packages & Pricing","pricingCtaSub":"See current rates and what each package includes for your area.","pittsburghButtonLabel":"Pittsburgh Bridal Beauty","atlantaButtonLabel":"Atlanta + New Orleans Bridal Beauty","leadParagraphs":["For brides seeking a professional bridal hair and makeup artist, we provide more than refined artistry—we provide reassurance. From your first inquiry, our bridal hair and makeup services prioritize clear, prompt communication and a seamless experience from booking through wedding day. We eliminate uncertainty, guide every step, and ensure you feel fully supported without the stress of chasing vendors or wondering what comes next.","Your bridal hair and makeup experience includes curated beauty services with a professional bridal hair and makeup artist, an optional (but recommended) wedding preview trial to refine your look ahead of time, and on-location hair and makeup services on your wedding day. You’ll also receive downloadable beauty guides to help you prepare, along with thoughtfully prepared touch-up kits to keep your hair and makeup looking flawless from ceremony through celebration.","Our role is simple: to make this part of your wedding feel effortless, elevated, and fully handled. We show up as your calm, fun, bestie-level hype squad—keeping the energy light and supportive so you can stay present and enjoy your day.","When you book our bridal hair and makeup services, you’re not just reserving a date—you’re securing a full-service bridal experience we’re genuinely excited to be part of."]},"services":{"pageHeader":"Bridal Services Breakdown","pricingCtaTitle":"Packages & Pricing","pricingCtaSub":"Bridal Hair and Makeup Packages & Pricing in Pittsburgh, Atlanta, and New Orleans","pittsburghButtonLabel":"Pittsburgh Bridal Beauty","atlantaButtonLabel":"Atlanta & New Orleans Bridal Beauty","introText":"This section outlines what’s included in your bridal hair and makeup packages, along with any additional options that may apply. You can also view regional pricing for Pittsburgh, Atlanta, and New Orleans in the sidebar.","sections":[{"title":"Package Investment Details","paragraphs":["<strong>Hair and/or Makeup Services</strong> — Customized, climate-adaptive hair and makeup designed for 12+ hour, tear-proof, and humidity-resistant wear.","<strong>Body Glow</strong> — Shoulders and collarbone for the bride.","<strong>Custom-fit event eyelashes</strong> — To enhance your eye shape and desired look for all guests receiving a makeup service.","<strong>Personalized Beauty Timeline</strong> — For the wedding day based on your services.","<strong>Lip touch-up kit</strong> — For all guests receiving a makeup service on the wedding day.","<strong>Final Polish</strong> — Services conclude with a final detail check and touch-up before our artists depart.","<strong>Travel to your location</strong> — We travel on location for every wedding; See travel notes for your location.","<strong>Gratuity included</strong> — Built into our total so you have one less checklist item.","<strong>Bridal Preview</strong> — At our artist's location, including up to two looks.","<strong>Booking fee</strong> — Covers all admin and keeps our communication organized and timely.","<strong>Exclusive Beauty Guide</strong> — A prep guide for booked clients to get the most out of your bridal beauty investment.","<strong>Smooth, guided process</strong> — From our booking coordinator, from first inquiry to your final looks."]},{"title":"Adding Additional Hair or Makeup Services","paragraphs":["Additional services can be added to your package total as needed up until 30 days before the wedding date, subject to artist availability. Please inquire for your city's rates. Services cannot be added on the day of the event.","Additional stylists can be added as needed — please inquire for your city's rates."]},{"title":"Travel Notes","paragraphs":["<strong>Georgia </strong> Travel is billed separately to your needs at $.70/mile, roundtrip, per artist.","<strong>Pittsburgh:</strong> Travel is billed separately to your needs at $.70/mile, roundtrip, per artist.","<strong>New Orleans or destination:</strong> Travel is billed separately to your needs at $.70/mile, roundtrip, per artist.","Travel over two hours from any location we operate in may require day-before or day-of accommodations, billed to the client."]},{"title":"Investments That May Apply","paragraphs":["<strong>Early start time fee of $100</strong> — Added to the final total for all services starting before 7:00 a.m.","<strong>Hourly fee</strong> — Applies for multiple events per day when an artist waits between service times.","<strong>Hourly fee</strong> — Applies for artists to stay on location for touch-ups beyond the final polish."]}],"cta":{"title":"Ready to book your bridal hair and makeup?","subtitle":"Get in touch to reserve your date","buttonText":"Contact us"}},"pittsburgh":{"documentTitle":"Bridal Hair & Makeup Artistry in Pittsburgh, PA | Wild Child Fabrications","metaDescription":"Bridal hair and makeup artistry in Pittsburgh, PA offering on-location wedding services, trials, and custom bridal beauty packages for brides, bridal parties, LGBTQ+ couples, and multicultural clients. Our all-inclusive packages reflect our most requested services, but we can also customize options based on your needs by booking individual services. Limited availability—booking recommended 8–10 months in advance.","pageHeader":"Pittsburgh Bridal Hair & Makeup","introBeforeLink":"Bridal hair and makeup packages for Pittsburgh , PA and surrounding areas. View our","servicesLinkText":"services breakdown","introAfterLink":"for full details on what each package includes.","packages":[{"title":"Bride Only - Wedding Day + Preview (No Bridal Party)","price":"$$1,125.00","items":["Bridal Hair + Makeup — customized, climate-adaptive, 12+ hour tear-proof and humidity-resistant wear","Body Glow on shoulders and collarbone","Custom fit event eyelashes to enhance your eye shape and desired look","Touch-up kit on the wedding day","Extensions placed at no additional cost for bride","Veil or accessory placement","Final Polish — detail check and touch-up before the artist departs","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Bridal Preview  (Trial) at artist's location — up to 2 looks","Booking fee — admin and organized, timely communication","Smooth, guided process from inquiry to final looks"],"detailText":"Travel billed according to clients specific location.\nGratuity not included."},{"title":"Bride + 3 Guests: Hair & Makeup for all","price":"$$1,695.00","items":["Bridal Hair + Makeup — customized, climate-adaptive, long-wear","Three additional guests hair + makeup — customized, long-wear & durable","Highly customized skin prep and setting sprays for each guest","Custom fit event eyelashes for each guest","Lip touch-up kit on the wedding day for each guest","Body glow on shoulders and collarbone for each guest","Extensions placed at no additional cost for bride","Veil or accessory placement","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Final Polish — detail check and touch-up before the artist departs","Gratuity included","Smooth, guided process from inquiry to final looks","Booking fee Included — admin and organized, timely communication"],"detailText":"Option to add on Bridal Preview (Trial) for $175 per service. \nTravel to be billed to clients specific needs.\nHair length above shoulders - base hair price decreases by $50.00\nHair length below mid back / extra long - base hair price increases by $25.00\nCan be customized to add on additional guests."},{"title":"Bride + 7 Guests: Hair Only","price":"$$1,605.00","items":["Bride hair styling — customized, climate-adaptive, 12+ hour durable wear","Up to 7 guests hair styling — customized for extended wear","Extensions placed for bride at no additional cost cost","Veil or accessory placement","Final Polish — detail check and touch-up before the artist departs","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Gratuity included","Booking fee Included — admin and organized, timely communication","Smooth, guided process from inquiry to final looks"],"detailText":"Option to add on Bridal Preview (Trial) for $175 per service. \nHair pricing based on base length of mid back - shorter or longer hair price varies.\n(Please see service breakdown below for pricing by length*)\nTravel to be billed to clients specific needs.\nCan be customized to add on additional guests."},{"title":"Bride + 7 Guests: Makeup Only","price":"$$1,605.00","items":["Bridal makeup — curated, long-wear application for heat, humidity & tears","Up to 7 guests makeup — customized, long wear & durable application","Highly customized skin prep and setting sprays for each guest","Custom fit event eyelashes for each guest","Lip touch-up kit on the wedding day for each guest","Body Glow on shoulders and collarbone for each guest","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Gratuity included","Booking fee Included — admin and organized, timely communication","Smooth, guided process from inquiry to final looks"],"detailText":"Option to add on Bridal Preview (Trial) for $175 per service. \nTravel to be billed to clients specific needs.\nCan be customized to add on additional guests."},{"title":"Same Sex  / Two Brides (No Bridal Party / Elopement Style)","price":"$$1,275.00","items":["Wedding Hair + Makeup —  2.5 hours per allotted per bride/groom to create your desired bridal look","Custom fitted event eyelashes to enhance your eye shape and desired look","Touch-up kits for both brides/grooms","Veil or accessory placements","Extensions placed at no additional cost","Bridal Body Glow on collarbone & shoulders","Final Polish — detail check and touch-up before the artist departs","Included gratuity","Smooth, guided process from first inquiry to last look","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Booking fee Included — admin and organized, timely communication"],"detailText":"Option to add in a bridal preview (trial) for $175.00 per service.\nTravel fee to be billed for clients specific needs.\nThis package is for the couples who do not need bridal party services / elopement style weddings."},{"title":"Groom / Male Presenting Touchups","price":"Add On Service","items":["Skin / blemish touchup — customize skin prep + light long-wear application, brow/facial hair pomade & styling (style only — no cut/shave) — $50","Hair styling (short) — polished & ready for photos — $50","Hair styling (below chin) — polished & ready for photos — $65"],"detailText":""},{"title":"Cost Per Service Breakdown","price":"Varies Per Service","items":["Bride Hair or Makeup - $225.00 per service","Bridal Party Makeup - $150.00 per service","Bridal Party Hair - $150.00* per service","(Hair above shoulders - $100.00)","(Hair below mid back / extra long - price varies based on length. $175.00+)","Booking fee - $75.00","Bridal Preview (Trial) - $175 per service for secured clients. For non secured clients, trials are $200 per service."],"detailText":"20% gratuity added in to final investment based on service count"}],"additionalSectionTitle":"Additional Investments That May Apply","additionalBullets":["Travel & parking fees will be applied based on your specific needs.","(Mileage/parking per artist booked will be applied.)","Early start time fee may apply before 7:30 a.m. — $100.","Additional stylists secured — $100 per stylist."],"cta":{"title":"Ready to book your bridal beauty experience?","subtitle":"Get in touch with us to secure your date!","buttonText":"Contact us"}},"atlanta":{"documentTitle":"Bridal Hair & Makeup Artistry in Atlanta & New Orleans | Wild Child Fabrications Hair + Makeup","metaDescription":"Bridal hair and makeup artist in Atlanta, GA and New Orleans, LA offering on-location wedding services, elopements, and custom bridal beauty packages for brides, bridal parties, LGBTQ+ or same sex couples, and multicultural clients. Our all-inclusive packages reflect our most requested services, but we can also customize options based on your needs by booking individual services. Limited availability—booking recommended 8–10 months in advance.","pageHeader":"Atlanta + New Orleans Bridal Hair & Makeup","introBeforeLink":"Bridal hair and makeup packages for Atlanta + New Orleans. View our","servicesLinkText":"services breakdown","introAfterLink":"for full details on what each package includes.","packages":[{"title":"Bride Only - Wedding Day + Trial (No Bridal Party)","price":"$$1,125.00","items":["Bridal Hair + Makeup — customized, climate-adaptive, 12+ hour tear-proof and humidity-resistant wear","Body Glow on shoulders and collarbone","Custom fit event eyelashes to enhance your eye shape and desired look","Touch-up kit on the wedding day","Extensions placed at no additional cost for bride","Veil or accessory placement","Final Polish — detail check and touch-up before the artist departs","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Bridal Preview  (Trial) at artist's location — up to 2 looks","Booking fee — admin and organized, timely communication","Smooth, guided process from inquiry to final looks"],"detailText":"Travel billed according to clients specific location.\nGratuity not included.\nOption to add in rehearsal dinner or special occasion services for $175 per service."},{"title":"Bride + 3 Guests: Hair & Makeup for all","price":"$$1,695.00","items":["Bridal Hair + Makeup — customized, climate-adaptive, long-wear","Three additional guests hair + makeup — customized, long-wear & durable","Highly customized skin prep and setting sprays for each guest","Custom fit event eyelashes for each guest","Lip touch-up kit on the wedding day for each guest","Body glow on shoulders and collarbone for each guest","Extensions placed at no additional cost for bride","Veil or accessory placement","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Final Polish — detail check and touch-up before the artist departs","Gratuity included","Smooth, guided process from inquiry to final looks","Booking fee Included — admin and organized, timely communication"],"detailText":"Option to add in a bridal preview (trial) for $175 per service. \nTravel fee to be billed for clients specific needs."},{"title":"Bride + 7 Guests: Hair Only","price":"$$1,605.00*","items":["Bride hair styling — customized, climate-adaptive, 12+ hour durable wear","Up to 7 guests hair styling — customized for extended wear","Extensions placed for bride at no additional cost cost","Veil or accessory placement","Final Polish — detail check and touch-up before the artist departs","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Gratuity included","Booking fee Included — admin and organized, timely communication","Smooth, guided process from inquiry to final looks"],"detailText":"Base Price for hair - $150 (mid back length) \nAbove shoulders or below mid back, please see below for pricing adjustment.\nOption to add in a bridal preview (trial) for $175 per service. \nTravel fee to be billed for clients specific needs."},{"title":"Bride + 7 Guests: Makeup Only","price":"$$1,605.00","items":["Bridal makeup — curated, long-wear application for heat, humidity & tears","Up to 7 guests makeup — customized, long wear & durable application","Highly customized skin prep and setting sprays for each guest","Custom fit event eyelashes for each guest","Lip touch-up kit on the wedding day for each guest","Body Glow on shoulders and collarbone for each guest","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Gratuity included","Booking fee Included — admin and organized, timely communication","Smooth, guided process from inquiry to final looks"],"detailText":"Option to add in a bridal preview (trial) for $175 per service. \nTravel fee to be billed for clients specific needs."},{"title":"Same Sex  / Two Brides (No bridal party / Elopement Style)","price":"$$1,275.00","items":["Wedding Hair + Makeup —  2.5 hours per allotted per bride/groom to create your desired bridal look","Custom fitted event eyelashes to enhance your eye shape and desired look","Touch-up kits for both brides/grooms","Veil or accessory placements","Extensions placed at no additional cost","Bridal Body Glow on collarbone & shoulders","Final Polish — detail check and touch-up before the artist departs","Included gratuity","Smooth, guided process from first inquiry to last look","Exclusive Bridal Beauty Guide — prep guide for secured clients","Booking fee Included — admin and organized, timely communication"],"detailText":"Option to add in a bridal preview (trial) for $175.00 per service.\nTravel fee to be billed for clients specific needs.\n**This package is for the couples who do not need bridal party services / elopement style weddings"},{"title":"Groom / Male Presenting Touch- ups","price":"Add-on","items":["Skin / blemish touchup — skin prep + light long-wear application, brow/facial hair pomade & styling (style only — no cut/shave) — $50","Hair styling (short style) — polished & ready for photos — $50","Hair styling (below chin) — polished & ready for photos — $65"],"detailText":""},{"title":"Cost Per Service","price":"Varies","items":["Bride Hair or Makeup - $225.00 per service","Bridal Party Makeup - $150.00 per service","Bridal Party Hair - $150* per service base length","(Hair above shoulders - $100.00)","(Hair below mid back / extra long - price varies based on length. $175+)","Booking fee - $75.00","Bridal Preview (Trial) - $175 per service for secured clients. For non secured clients, it is $200 per service.","20% gratuity added in to final investment based on service count."],"detailText":"Flower girl hair + blush, gloss & glitter eye shadow can be added on to any package for $60. Ages 3-9 only."}],"additionalSectionTitle":"Additional Investments That May Apply","additionalBullets":["Early start time fee (before 7:00 a.m.) — $100.","Additional stylists — $100 per stylist.","Travel is billed (per artist secured) to clients specific location."],"cta":{"title":"Ready to book your bridal beauty experience?","subtitle":"Get in touch to secure your date","buttonText":"Contact us"}}},"regionsNotice":""}]}]
